            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "home-why-0-span",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "At SAIS-Abu Dhabi, we believe that education is more than academics, it’s about nurturing confident, capable, and compassionate individuals who are ready to thrive in a rapidly changing world."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "85f4684d8b31",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "cbaafe201cb7",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Our journey began in 2019, and in a short time, we have become one of the most respected American curriculum schools in the region. Backed by the legacy of the Sharjah American International School (established in 1997), our Abu Dhabi campus reflects a rich tradition of academic excellence, innovation, and strong values."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Why SAIS-Abu Dhabi?"
      },
